P3
# The missing-texture stand-in. ADR 0021 requires a visible placeholder rather than a crash: a
# missing asset must still draw something and report itself, because the agent's only eyes are
# render.describe and render.capture.
#
# Plain ASCII PPM (P3) on purpose. It is a real image format that is also a hand-editable text file,
# which is the same trade every other format in this project makes (invariant I1). A 4x4 magenta and
# near-black check reads unmistakably as "this is not the texture you wanted".
4 4
255
230 0 230   26 26 31   230 0 230   26 26 31
26 26 31    230 0 230  26 26 31    230 0 230
230 0 230   26 26 31   230 0 230   26 26 31
26 26 31    230 0 230  26 26 31    230 0 230
